        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=\\dfrac{-5\\pm\\sqrt{65}}{4}$",
          "worked": "The quadratic coefficients are $2$, $5$ and $-5$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}b^2-4ac&=5^2-4(2)(-5)\\\\b^2-4ac&=65\\\\a&=\\frac{-5\\pm\\sqrt{65}}{4}\\end{align*}$$",
